The plate is a square side plate, roughly 20-22 cm across. It holds about 8 pieces of roasted sweet potato, each around 3-4 cm. Allowing for some pieces being larger and some smaller, I estimate about 12-15 g per piece, which comes to roughly 100-120 g in total.

Roasted sweet potato with a little oil runs about 1.1-1.3 kcal/g. That gives about 130 kcal.

